---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Checking Halal Status for Drink Shops | BBTea.sg" description="How to check a Singapore drink outlet's current halal certification before ordering." canonical="https://bbtea.sg/halal/">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold">Check halal status before ordering</h1>
    <p>We are not publishing halal badges or a certified-outlet list until we can attach supporting evidence to each listing. An absent badge on BBTea.sg does not mean a shop is not halal-certified.</p>
    <p>For current certification information, use <a href="https://www.muis.gov.sg/halal/" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MUIS's halal information and directory</a>. Check the exact outlet rather than assuming a brand's other branches have the same status.</p>
    <p>If certification matters for your order, confirm it with the outlet before buying. A menu description or reader review is not a substitute for certification evidence.</p>
    <p><a href="/directory/" class="underline">Browse drink shops</a> or <a href="/contact/" class="underline">send a correction with a source</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
